    label(card, "Tick the units to use. ★ = one the farm's own safe rule would take. ⚠ = something worth keeping. Nothing ticked: the farm picks by its safe rule. Locked and equipped units never show: lock one in the game to keep it out.",
        10, Enum.Font.Gotham, COL.sub or Color3.fromRGB(166, 178, 208), 2)
    -- the list
